# Business / marketing — intentionally kept out of this public repo.
# Local copies also live in D:\Claude\ShiftWork-private
#
# Every directory rule below is anchored with a leading slash so it matches ONLY
# at the repo root. Unanchored, `Templates/` also matched `webapp/web/templates/`
# (git's ignore matching is case-insensitive here, core.ignorecase=true), which
# silently excluded the app's own Jinja templates from being added.
/ShiftWork-Business-Plan.*
/ShiftWork-Pricing-Tiers.md
/ShiftWork-Facebook-Launch-Plan.md
/CRM_MVP_DESIGN.md
/FEATURE-GAPS.md
/assets/

# Customer-facing roster templates and sample rosters
/Templates/
/Shift Template*.xlsx

# Design canvas / wireframes and their generated runtime
/ShiftWork Wireframes.dc.html
/Wireframe Screens Project.zip
/support.js
/.thumbnail

# Solver output, backups and superseded code
/output/
/output.csv
/output.xlsx
*.bak
/shiftwork_pre_opt.py
/old_code/
